- Camera and Storage: Used exclusively when you choose to attach images, scan text with OCR, or add files to your notes.
- Biometrics / Security: Fingerprint lock or master password authentication is processed locally on your device to protect your privacy.

4. Changes to This Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We encourage you to review it periodically.

5. Contact Us
If you have any questions or suggestions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us via email at: contacto.developmenstudio@gmail.com

